  "details": "Hi, VR Chat Team/Dev/Moderator.\n\nI have a friends concerning with full body tracking arm motion after the most recent update.\nFollowing will be the english translation of his question translated by English with his original Japanese Strings.\n\n====================================================\nHi, VRChat Team.\n\nI've noticed the arm motion of HTC Vive Fulltracking has been changed from previouw update.\nWhen I bend my arm/elbow the should bone seems to draged to back, I can't bend my arm in VRChat.\n\nPlease see the picture attached.\n\nWhen full tracking setting has been OFF this won't happen but it will repron when the full body tracking has been ON.\n\nThis issue happen to the other HTC Vive's full body tracking users also.\n\nCan you change back to previous arm motion please?\n\n=============Original Japanese Strings================\nこんにちは、VRCHAT\n\n前回のアップデートから、HTC VIVEのフルボディトラッキングで、腕の動きが変わりました。\n現実で肘を曲げた場合、肩のボーンが後ろに下がって、肘がうまく曲がりません。\n\nフルボディトラッキングをOFFにすると直りますが、ONにすると再度同じバグが発生します。\n\n私だけではなく、HTC VIVEのフルボディトラッキングを使っているフレンドも、同じでした。\n\n前回のアップデードで変わった腕の動きを、元に戻すことはできますか？",
